[I] Time zone object base class and factory

[T] DateTime::TimeZone provides time zone objects for DateTime, built from
[T] the Olson tz database, including the offsets and daylight saving rules
[T] of each zone and detection of the local time zone.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/DateTime-TimeZone

